&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Desktop application for creating and managing &lt;strong>movement animations&lt;/strong> for spatial audio tracks on the &lt;a href="https://holophonix.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Holophonix&lt;/a> processor.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>It communicates with Holophonix via the &lt;strong>OSC&lt;/strong> protocol and lets you define trajectories and dynamic behaviours for sound sources in 3D space.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Create movement behaviours (circles, lines, free trajectories)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Manage multiple tracks simultaneously&lt;/li>
&lt;li>OSC synchronisation with Holophonix&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Desktop GUI (Electron/Node.js)&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
